### Test Single Note Pin/Unpin API (matches your frontend format)
### Make sure your backend is running on http://localhost:5000

### STEP 1: Test Pin a Note (set IsPinned to true)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/Notes/pinUnpinNotes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "NoteId": 1,
  "IsPinned": true
}

### STEP 2: Test Unpin a Note (set IsPinned to false)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/Notes/pinUnpinNotes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "NoteId": 1,
  "IsPinned": false
}

### STEP 3: Test with different note ID
POST http://localhost:5000/api/Notes/pinUnpinNotes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "NoteId": 2,
  "IsPinned": true
}

### STEP 4: Test Bulk Pin/Unpin (if needed in future)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/Notes/bulkPinUnpinNotes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "NoteIdList": ["1", "2", "3"],
  "IsPinned": true
}
